sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as WalletController
    participant WS as WalletService
    participant Coin as CoinsService
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext

    C->>API: GET /api/wallet
    Note over API: [Authorize] validates JWT before controller
    API->>API: Extract userId from claims (NameIdentifier or sub)
    alt missing/invalid userId
        API-->>C: 401 Unauthorized {message}
    else userId ok
        API->>WS: GetWalletAsync(userId)
        WS->>DB: Load wallet (+holdings + coin) by userId
        alt wallet missing
            WS->>DB: Create wallet (Balance=0)
            WS->>DB: SaveChanges
        end
        loop for each holding
            WS->>Coin: GetCurrentPriceAsync(holding.CoinId)
            Coin->>DB: Read coin current price (CoinsMarket)
            DB-->>Coin: price
            Coin-->>WS: price
            WS->>WS: holding.CurrentValue = qty * price
            WS->>WS: holding.Profit = CurrentValue - (AverageBuyPrice * qty)
        end
        WS-->>API: EWalletDto {balance, holdings[]}
        API-->>C: 200 OK (EWalletDto)
    end
